      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: \n\nI think it's good to use Branding.Major.Mimor instead of semantic versioning if you explicitly declare and follow the declaration.\n\nI think Branding.Major.Mimor is less confusing for end users, who mostly doesn't know Semantic Versioning.\n\nVRCSDK did breaking changes in minor versions and added new features in patch versions. VRC sometimes says please use `3.2.x`. For those reasons, I thought VRCSDK want to use Branding.Major.Minor as their versioning.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
