      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Thanks for the feedback - we've discussed it and we're going to use \"Branding.Breaking.Bumps\" as described here: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-12-october-2023/20354#sdk-semantic-versioning-6",
